WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:01.679
- I don't know a lot of lotion people,

00:00:01.679 --> 00:00:02.755
but I know they do a lot of this.

00:00:02.755 --> 00:00:03.883
(light scratchy noise)

00:00:03.883 --> 00:00:04.960
(light clapping)

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.960
(uptempo beat)

00:00:10.132 --> 00:00:11.390
- Bath &amp; Body Works is a store

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:13.473
that I never want to go in at the mall,

00:00:13.473 --> 00:00:15.850
but I always get dragged
to it by my girlfriend.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.355
- Early 2000s, all my girlfriends were 12,

00:00:19.355 --> 00:00:21.691
but we were all like, "Let's go!"

00:00:21.691 --> 00:00:23.408
- I think they have a lot of soap.

00:00:23.408 --> 00:00:26.283
I think that they have a lot of baskets

00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:27.654
that have soap in it.

00:00:27.654 --> 00:00:31.260
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.125
(sniffing sound)

00:00:42.185 --> 00:00:43.261
- This feels like something that

00:00:43.261 --> 00:00:44.511
a 12 year old girl would wear.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.217
- Like I'm walking through the woods

00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:50.220
in Medieval England and
I'm picking a cherry

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.469
and I smell it.

00:00:51.469 --> 00:00:54.730
- I would call this
Watermelon Body Butter.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:56.176
- Dainty Moonberry Sunrise.

00:00:56.176 --> 00:00:58.888
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:58.888 --> 00:01:00.219
(gasps and chokes)

00:01:00.219 --> 00:01:01.802
- Okay, that was a bad idea.

00:01:01.802 --> 00:01:02.898
- This should be called

00:01:02.898 --> 00:01:05.407
Holy Crap, Don't Spray
This Anywhere Near Children

00:01:05.407 --> 00:01:07.490
'Cause They Will Light On Fire.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:09.982
- Laundry's Done! That's
what this should be called.

00:01:09.982 --> 00:01:12.407
It does smell very fresh. I'd wear it.

00:01:12.407 --> 00:01:14.621
(upbeat jazz music)

00:01:14.621 --> 00:01:16.084
- Oh, this smells like hairspray.

00:01:16.084 --> 00:01:17.740
You can call this Aqua Net.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:19.744
- Old Lady's House by Bed Bath &amp; Beyond.

00:01:19.744 --> 00:01:23.510
- Plumeria? That's awful.

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:25.095
- Oh! Happy Birthday, honey.

00:01:25.095 --> 00:01:26.263
I got you Plumeria.

00:01:26.263 --> 00:01:27.634
What, you got me a disease?

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:30.672
No, it's this awesome fragrance
from Bath &amp; Body Works!

00:01:30.672 --> 00:01:33.141
(upbeat jazz music)

00:01:33.141 --> 00:01:36.188
- Looks like I'm about to
put some mayo on my skin.

00:01:36.188 --> 00:01:38.393
- This is like I'm in Paris, France

00:01:38.393 --> 00:01:40.567
hanging out with Kanye West.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.111
- This has gotta be lemon hand lotion.

00:01:42.111 --> 00:01:43.472
- This is why I don't use lotion

00:01:43.472 --> 00:01:45.524
'cause my hands feel creepy right now.

00:01:45.524 --> 00:01:47.558
(upbeat jazz music)

00:01:48.838 --> 00:01:52.003
- (sniffing noise) Oooh.

00:01:52.003 --> 00:01:53.288
- I hate to be talking
about poop right now,

00:01:53.288 --> 00:01:55.706
it's not my style, but
that's how bad this smells.

00:01:55.706 --> 00:01:57.210
- I would buy this for
my girlfriend, for sure.

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.754
- I like this one, but this again just

00:01:58.754 --> 00:02:00.582
smells like a very juvenile smell.

00:02:00.582 --> 00:02:02.126
- At Bed Bath &amp; Beyond, they just do

00:02:02.126 --> 00:02:03.254
whatever the hell they want.

00:02:03.254 --> 00:02:05.245
They make up smells.

00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:07.843
- Err. What did I say?

00:02:07.843 --> 00:02:10.876
(upbeat jazz music)

00:02:10.876 --> 00:02:14.426
- Hello, old friend! I would
recognize her anywhere!

00:02:14.426 --> 00:02:16.183
(light clapping)

00:02:16.183 --> 00:02:17.554
(sniffing noise)

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:18.855
- Man, I wanna eat this one.

00:02:18.855 --> 00:02:20.358
This one smells like candy.

00:02:20.358 --> 00:02:24.677
- I feel this one would be the
Britney Spears of the lotion.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.900
- I can't stop smelling my hands.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.272
They just smell great.

00:02:28.272 --> 00:02:31.157
- Bath &amp; Body Works, thank
you for everything you've done

00:02:31.157 --> 00:02:32.945
in the past 20 years.

00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:35.241
You've helped a lot of
stinky teens make it through.

00:02:35.241 --> 00:02:37.364
- In the 90s, I was a little kid.

00:02:37.364 --> 00:02:41.367
I was smelling Play Doh,
N64 cartridges, Gak.

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:44.087
- Bath &amp; Body has some good stuff there.

00:02:44.087 --> 00:02:47.673
Probably still won't go,
but I appreciate them

00:02:47.673 --> 00:02:48.628
for what they are.

00:02:48.628 --> 00:02:51.473
- I didn't tell my girlfriend
I was going to be in this.

00:02:51.473 --> 00:02:54.215
I'm wondering what she's going
to think when I get home,

00:02:54.215 --> 00:02:57.799
(laughs) if I come home
smelling like a 90s girl.

